Subject: [PATCH] Restore the nudge, compact-actions and filename test cases
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Three more suites lost their fork cases the same way: the one-time toast that
points a web user at the opt-in in-room search shortcut, the wrapper class the
compact action bar keys off, and a video named by its filename rather than by
its caption. All three behaviours are live here and were left with nothing
asserting them.

The two nudge cases now drive a native keydown on the body instead of typing
through the harness. The nudge deliberately hangs off the document listener's
nothing-focused path so the browser find bar is never suppressed, and typed
input reaches the React handler instead, which bypasses it entirely — the
original cases passed only on a harness where the two paths coincided.
---
 .../structures/LoggedInView.test.tsx          | 44 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../message-body/VideoBodyViewModel.test.ts   | 14 ++++++
 2 files changed, 57 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

